TITLE Calcite dissolution kinetics at 200C with Cu and Ba - rate constant 10

SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10.0
    Ba        5.0
    -water    1.0  # kg

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  1.0  10.0
    -step   1000 in 100

INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetics2.sel
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -kinetic_reactants  Calcite

END
